        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-stance-p08-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "其实 + correcting proposition",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "其实 introduces a fact that corrects an impression or assumption. Connect it to the belief being revised, not to an unrelated extra fact.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你觉得他很忙，其实他很有时间。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ juéde tā hěn máng ， qíshí tā hěn yǒu shíjiān 。",
                "meaning": "You think he is busy, but actually he has plenty of time.",
                "audio": "f9b2a4c85e8611470650614787f2a2aa29f329704774889f1f3580b1ed75d997"
              },
              {
                "text": "其实我不喜欢茶。",
                "pinyin": "qíshí wǒ bù xǐhuan chá 。",
                "meaning": "Actually, I do not like tea.",
                "audio": "7abb4e32e049dbe425125914803a84c9bee88ae2b5b6390fd3e1923e03840883"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
